<title>USA: Muni dealers traded $889 mln bonds Wednesday - MSRB.</title>
<headline>Muni dealers traded $889 mln bonds Wednesday - MSRB.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Municipal bond dealers traded $889.0 million of bonds Wednesday on 3,452 trades, the Municipal Securities Rulemaking Board said.</p>
<p>A total of 2,094 individual issues changed hands, with 77 of those trading four or more times, MSRB said, citing figures from an automated clearance system of interdealer trades.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
